/* UNIFIED FLIGHT OS (REV 6.20)
   LCDs: "HUD LCD", "HUD Data LCD", "Nav Data LCD", "IGC Data LCD", "Sys Data LCD"
   Cockpit CustomData: Screen_0=HUD|SYS|NAV|HUDDATA|IGC

   COMMANDS:
   - REFRESH / PURGE / REFRESH:FULL: Rescan topology / Wipe Storage & soft-reset.
   - ABORT: Emergency purge; reset thruster/gyro overrides.
   - GPS:[Name] / GPS:SHARE[:Name]: Save position to CustomData / Save & broadcast via IGC.
   - NAV:WAY:[Suffix]: Run route matching waypoint suffix.
   - NAV:PAUSE / NAV:RESUME: Pause or resume active route.
   - NAV:NEXT / NAV:PREV: Cycle waypoint selection array.
   - NAV:CLEAR / DELETE / SHARE: Clear waypoints / Delete target / Broadcast waypoints.
   - NAV:FLY[:Dist]: Auto-fly to target (optional stop distance in meters).
   - PAN:[Dir]:[Dist]: Translate (UP/DOWN/LEFT/RIGHT/FWD/BACK) set distance.
   - DOCK:[PortName]: Save port when connected / Auto-dock when undocked.
   - POS:SET:[Name] / GO:[Name] / [Name]: Record position stop / Translate & align to stop.
   - POS:UP / DOWN / CLEAR: Step position stops / Clear stored stops (Alias: ELEVATOR).
   - TRACK:NAV / TRACK:IGC: Lock GPS Waypoints or Friendly IGC Signals.
   - IGC:NEXT / IGC:PREV: Cycle target indexing through registered network.
   - HUD:TOGGLE / NAV:TOGGLE / HUD:CLEAN: Toggle HUD render / Toggle minimal UI.
   - HUD+ / HUD- / HUD:BRIGHT:[Val]/+/-: Adjust optic zoom scale / Set brightness (0.1-3.0).
   - LAND: Controlled 2.5m/s slow descent (works in zero-G or aligns to gravity).
   - LAND[:Alt] / GRAVITY / DROP: High-G descent / Flare landing / Powered drop.
   - LAND:RUNWAY: Glide path (-5m/s descent, reverse rollout >10m/s).
   - LAND:ROCKET[:Alt] / ROCKET:LAND: High-G vertical tail-engine descent.
   - LAUNCH[:Alt] / ROCKET[:Alt]: Undock & vertical climb to target altitude.
   - LAUNCH:RUNWAY[:Speed]: Runway rollout macro (10% downforce, rotation).
   - DOCK / UNDOCK: Lock gear/connectors & stockpile H2 / Unlock & restore flight state.
   - SYS:OFF / SYS:ON: Deactivate/activate non-critical grid functional blocks (connectors stay ON).
   - ALIGN:TOGGLE / TARGET: Toggle gravity align / Align nose to target vector.
   - ALIGN:PROGRADE / RETROGRADE: Align nose to prograde / retrograde velocity vector.
   - PLANE:FLIGHT / BANK=[N]/+/-/OFF: Aerodynamic bank turns / Set bank angle (max 89°).
   - CRS=[N]/+/- / CRS:TOGGLE: Set or adjust forward cruise speed / Toggle cruise.
   - VERT=[N]/+/- / VERT:TOGGLE: Set or adjust vertical speed / Toggle vertical loop.
   - ALIGN=[N]/+/-: Set or adjust pitch trim angle offset relative to horizon.
   - FLIP / FLIP:BURN: 180° retrograde rotation / Flip with engine braking burn.
   - P=[N] / Y=[N] / R=[N]: Inject relative Pitch, Yaw, or Roll adjustments in degrees.
*/

